@startuml 00-system-context
!include ../_style.iuml
left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ranksep 110
title Nós no Cabo v1 — System context

actor "Visitor" as visitor
actor "Submitter\n(anyone)" as submitter
actor "Site owner" as owner
actor "Reviewer\n(project owner)" as reviewer

rectangle "nos-client\nReact SPA\nnosnocabo.com.br" as spa
rectangle "API gateway\napi.nosnocabo.com.br/v1" as gateway
rectangle "Router\nnosnocabo.com.br/ring/*, /r/*" as router
rectangle "Services\ncatalog · moderation\nverification · metrics" as services
rectangle "Cloudflare Turnstile\n(bot check)" as turnstile <<external>>
rectangle "Workers AI\n(content check)" as ai <<external>>
rectangle "Email Routing\nalertas@nosnocabo.com.br" as email <<external>>
rectangle "Browser push services\n(Web Push)" as push <<external>>
rectangle "Member websites\n(optional webring widget)" as members <<external>>

visitor --> spa : browse, search,\nvote, report
visitor --> router : Visitar site,\nshort links
submitter --> spa : submit any site
owner --> members : installs widget
owner --> spa : Verificar
members --> router : widget links\n/ring/:id/next|prev|random

spa --> gateway : REST /v1
spa --> turnstile : token on every write
gateway --> services : service bindings
router --> services : RPC: ring, record click
router --> members : 302
services --> turnstile : siteverify
services --> members : scrape metadata,\ncheck widget
services --> ai : classify text
services --> email : alerts
email --> reviewer : new site, report
reviewer --> email : reply "dismiss" | "ban"
services --> push : decision for the submitter
push --> submitter : notification

note right of services
  <b>Community-driven</b>: submissions need no account.
  A site is public only after the content check passes.
  <b>Verified</b> = the widget is on the site. Recent clicks,
  total clicks and verification rank "Melhores" (ADR 0004).
  No per-IP limits: Turnstile, a daily AI budget,
  moderation and review protect the writes.
end note

@enduml
